{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約拿書","commonName":"約拿書","title":"約拿書","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"f91d6b16eb9a5d63ebd94eb0437fbc5c9dbfa1e954ec315b49b5370c5c15f3ef","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["這事令約拿十分不悅，非常惱怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他向耶和華禱告說：「耶和華啊，我在家鄉的時候豈不早就說過你會這樣做嗎？我知道你是一位有恩典、好憐憫的上帝，不輕易發怒，充滿慈愛，不忍心降災，所以我才急速逃往他施。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華啊，求你收回我的性命吧，我死了比活著還好！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華對他說：「你這樣大發脾氣合理嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["約拿出城，在城東為自己搭了一個棚，坐在棚下蔭涼處，要看看尼尼微城究竟會怎樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華上帝安排了一棵蓖麻迅速地長起來，為約拿遮蔭，使他的頭免受日曬。約拿因有這棵蓖麻而非常歡喜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第二天黎明的時候，上帝卻安排了一條蟲來咬這棵蓖麻，蓖麻就枯萎了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["太陽出來的時候，上帝颳起燥熱的東風，烈日把約拿曬得發昏，他就再次求死說：「我死了比活著還好！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["上帝對約拿說：「你為這棵蓖麻大發脾氣合理嗎？」約拿回答說：「我就是氣死了也合理。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和華說：「這棵蓖麻不是你種的，也不是你栽培的，它在一夜之間長成，又在一夜之間死去，你尚且如此愛惜，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我怎能不愛惜這尼尼微大城呢？城中單是連左右手都分不清的人就有十二萬多，還有許多的牲畜。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}